Redistributed data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

data/treasury_par_yields_2025.csv
    US Treasury Daily Par Yield Curve Rates (CMT), published by the US
    Department of the Treasury.
    https://home.treasury.gov/resource-center/data-chart-center/interest-rates/TextView?type=daily_treasury_yield_curve
    A work of the US Government, not subject to copyright protection in the
    United States (17 U.S.C. 105). Redistributed unmodified apart from column
    reordering and a provenance header.

data/sofr_overnight_2025.csv
    SOFR (Secured Overnight Financing Rate) overnight fixing, retrieved from
    FRED (Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis). SOFR is published by the Federal
    Reserve Bank of New York, which is the rate administrator and the source of
    the data. Use is subject to the New York Fed's Terms of Use for Select Rate
    Data and to FRED's terms of use.
    https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/SOFR
    https://www.newyorkfed.org/markets/reference-rates/terms-of-use-for-select-rate-data

